sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Device as Limited-Input Device<br/>CLI / TV
    participant AS as Authorization Server
    participant Browser as Browser on Another Device
    participant API as Resource Server API

    Device->>AS: POST /device_authorization<br/>client_id, scope
    AS->>Device: device_code, user_code,<br/>verification_uri, interval, expires_in
    Device->>User: Show user_code and verification_uri
    User->>Browser: Open verification_uri<br/>and enter user_code
    Browser->>AS: User authenticates<br/>and approves access
    loop Poll until approved or expired
        Device->>AS: POST /token<br/>grant_type=device_code<br/>device_code
        AS->>Device: authorization_pending<br/>or slow_down<br/>or tokens
    end
    AS->>Device: access_token<br/>optional refresh_token
    Device->>API: API request<br/>Authorization: Bearer access_token
    API->>Device: Protected response
